    "# PerfectPetClub - Data Engineering ETL Pipeline\n",
    "This notebook  Extract, Transform and Loads supplied database.\n",
    "\n",
    "### The pipeline:\n",
    "Extracts records from a CSV file.\n",
    "\n",
    "Cleans and standardises extracted data.\n",
    "\n",
    "Exports the cleaned dataset in CSV and Parquet formats.\n",
    "\n",
    "Displays the original and transformed datasets for validation.\n"
   ]
